            "title": "CBL & Associates Properties: Evaluating Valuation After New Mayfaire Hotel and Retail Expansions Boost Growth Prospects",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "CBL & Associates Properties (CBL) just opened the doors to a brand-new Element by Westin hotel at its Mayfaire Town Center in Wilmington, North Carolina, marking another chapter in its ongoing expansion efforts. This move, accomplished through a joint venture with Vision Hospitality, brings 139 hotel rooms to a destination that has already welcomed over 100,000 square feet of new shops, dining options, and entertainment since last year. For investors, the real story is how these additions,...",
